1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,960
=Episode 35=

4
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:42,900
It bears the seal of the Anzhou
Prefectural Office.

5
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:44,859
Then this matter

6
00:01:45,579 --> 00:01:46,499
can be considered done.

7
00:01:47,419 --> 00:01:48,219
Then can we

8
00:01:48,299 --> 00:01:49,820
return to the capital and report back?

9
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,980
When the Three Judicial Offices
convene for the trial,

10
00:01:53,579 --> 00:01:54,579
it will be the day
when those responsible

11
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:57,339
finally answer for what they did
to Lord Shen.

12
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:00,460
I can only block this water route
for one day.

13
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:01,980
After today,

14
00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:03,100
I don't know what I can do.

15
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:04,859
As for the official salt from Minzhou,

16
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:06,460
I can only move a few thousand catties.

17
00:02:06,660 --> 00:02:08,100
There's no way to put it
into circulation.

18
00:02:08,419 --> 00:02:09,179
What will you

19
00:02:09,419 --> 00:02:10,299
do next?

20
00:02:11,739 --> 00:02:13,419
Evidence from Anzhou alone

21
00:02:13,699 --> 00:02:15,179
won't be enough to bring down
Grand Secretary Yu.

22
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,459
If we want the officials

23
00:02:17,699 --> 00:02:19,299
to join together and testify
against him,

24
00:02:20,179 --> 00:02:20,780
Feiyu,

25
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:22,139
you're with the Imperial Guards.

26
00:02:22,459 --> 00:02:23,260
You're more reliable than I am.

27
00:02:24,299 --> 00:02:25,820
We need to split up.

28
00:02:25,899 --> 00:02:27,220
The identity of Jiuweijiao

29
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:28,299
won't last much longer.

30
00:02:29,419 --> 00:02:30,019
From now on,

31
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:31,100
I'll work in the open,

32
00:02:31,459 --> 00:02:32,139
and you'll work in the shadows.

33
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:33,739
As long as I hold out long enough,

34
00:02:34,139 --> 00:02:35,699
I'll buy you more time.

35
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:38,459
Then what about you?

36
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:40,100
Don't worry, Lord Qin.

37
00:02:40,179 --> 00:02:41,820
Before we became officials,

38
00:02:41,820 --> 00:02:42,940
we were bandits.

39
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:44,380
The ability to survive

40
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,100
is something we were born with.

41
00:02:47,780 --> 00:02:49,579
But you're traveling everywhere
so people across the realm

42
00:02:49,579 --> 00:02:50,540
can have salt to eat.

43
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:56,060
Your safety matters more than mine.

44
00:02:56,739 --> 00:02:57,340
From now on,

45
00:02:58,699 --> 00:02:59,579
I'll cover you.

46
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:04,859
I

47
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:05,540
will not

48
00:03:05,619 --> 00:03:06,540
fail you.

49
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:16,699
I wonder how things
are going in the capital.

50
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:44,540
I wonder how he's doing now.

51
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,579
Mr. Zhao

52
00:03:46,579 --> 00:03:47,899
always had a way out.

53
00:03:48,459 --> 00:03:49,299
Madam,

54
00:03:49,299 --> 00:03:50,699
don't worry about him.

55
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:53,660
You're right.

56
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:56,940
Worrying won't change anything.

57
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:59,739
I should do something useful
to help him instead.

58
00:04:00,220 --> 00:04:01,820
It's been around a hundred days
since Mr. Zhao left the capital.

59
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:03,459
The mourning period is over.

60
00:04:04,459 --> 00:04:05,980
It's time for you to step outside again,
Madam.

61
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:09,780
Summon the managers

62
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:11,980
of all Xie branches.

63
00:04:13,179 --> 00:04:14,179
Starting today,

64
00:04:14,419 --> 00:04:16,540
all grocery stores under Xie

65
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:19,580
selling rice, flour, oil, tea, and salt

66
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,460
will all switch to using
gold-weighted scales.

67
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:25,059
Before Mr. Zhao left,

68
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:26,660
we made a promise.

69
00:04:27,379 --> 00:04:28,619
We gave it three months.

70
00:04:30,619 --> 00:04:31,819
No matter whether

71
00:04:32,259 --> 00:04:34,379
he can bring back the evidence,

72
00:04:35,299 --> 00:04:37,660
I will expose the Yu family's lies

73
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,980
and give the people the justice
they deserve.

74
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,259
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)

75
00:04:42,259 --> 00:04:43,100
Excuse me.

76
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:44,179
What's going on?

77
00:04:44,179 --> 00:04:46,100
Why does the amount seem off today?

78
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,140
Off?

79
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,859
It seems like there's more than usual.

80
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:49,980
That can't be.

81
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:50,499
Let me weigh it for you.

82
00:04:50,499 --> 00:04:52,259
Mine was more than usual
the other day too.

83
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:53,660
So was mine.

84
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:54,700
That's right.

85
00:04:54,780 --> 00:04:55,819
Really?

86
00:04:55,819 --> 00:04:56,939
They're truly honest merchants.

87
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:57,700
Look.

88
00:04:57,859 --> 00:04:58,980
Three catties. Exactly right.

89
00:04:59,179 --> 00:05:01,340
Could it be other shops have been
giving you less than you paid for?

90
00:05:01,340 --> 00:05:02,499
When it comes to the scales,

91
00:05:02,499 --> 00:05:03,580
we would never dare cheat.

92
00:05:03,819 --> 00:05:06,020
A merchant's scale is a measure
of our integrity.

93
00:05:06,299 --> 00:05:08,379
It is also the standard by which
the authorities ensure fairness.

94
00:05:08,619 --> 00:05:09,220
Good!

95
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:10,580
This Xie Rice and Flour Shop

96
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:11,540
is truly a fair and honest business.

97
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,379
All of Xie's shops

98
00:05:13,379 --> 00:05:14,619
have switched to gold-weighted scales.

99
00:05:14,819 --> 00:05:16,540
After weighing every catty of goods,

100
00:05:16,540 --> 00:05:17,619
they always give a little extra.

101
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:19,660
This woman

102
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:21,580
is really troublesome.

103
00:05:22,259 --> 00:05:24,100
She can afford to keep losing money,

104
00:05:25,179 --> 00:05:26,540
but other businesses

105
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:28,299
can't withstand the pressure.

106
00:05:28,859 --> 00:05:30,340
Ever since she changed the scales,

107
00:05:30,859 --> 00:05:32,540
our losses have been piling up.

108
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:37,819
Xie's shops were the private property
my mother left me.

109
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:41,980
I can't afford to worry
about losing this money.

110
00:05:43,419 --> 00:05:44,859
I have to make this as big as possible

111
00:05:45,499 --> 00:05:46,780
and drag the Yu family into it.

112
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:48,340
If this continues, it may draw

113
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,460
the attention of the Military
and the Market Administration Office.

114
00:05:50,619 --> 00:05:51,780
Given enough time,

115
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:53,220
the people will start to believe

116
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:55,020
that every shop except Xie

117
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:56,580
has been shortchanging them.

118
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,419
They'll be forced
to prove their own innocence.

119
00:05:59,419 --> 00:06:00,700
That's exactly what I want.

120
00:06:01,819 --> 00:06:03,499
The type of scale I use doesn't matter.

121
00:06:03,859 --> 00:06:05,020
What matters is letting the people know

122
00:06:05,140 --> 00:06:07,419
that there is another standard
of measure in this world.

123
00:06:08,220 --> 00:06:09,980
Whether I win or lose doesn't matter.

124
00:06:10,419 --> 00:06:11,619
What matters is letting them know

125
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,939
that some people can keep winning
simply because they have power.

126
00:06:13,939 --> 00:06:14,739
That's what truly matters.

127
00:06:15,179 --> 00:06:16,619
But if this exposes

128
00:06:16,939 --> 00:06:19,020
the authorities hiding the gold weights,

129
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:21,259
we'll be in trouble.

130
00:06:21,819 --> 00:06:24,379
She's using money to win over the people

131
00:06:24,499 --> 00:06:26,140
and build support for Zhao Ling.

132
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,220
Zhao Ling?

133
00:06:27,939 --> 00:06:29,100
It has to be it.

134
00:06:29,379 --> 00:06:30,739
Zhao Ling must have gone after

135
00:06:30,739 --> 00:06:32,619
those gold weights.

136
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:33,819
Once this matter

137
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:36,499
comes to light,

138
00:06:37,619 --> 00:06:39,340
it will provoke public outrage.

139
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,419
And the Yu family...

140
00:06:41,859 --> 00:06:43,499
Grand Secretary Yu understands
power better than anyone.

141
00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,020
What he fears most

142
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,020
is that the people will eventually

143
00:06:47,259 --> 00:06:48,700
come to understand

144
00:06:49,059 --> 00:06:50,499
what power truly means.

145
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:52,660
After all, they still have
no actual proof.

146
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,140
She's using public opinion against me.

147
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:56,980
When enough people repeat a lie,

148
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,379
it can destroy anyone.

149
00:06:58,460 --> 00:06:59,739
Who needs a formal conviction then?

150
00:07:00,499 --> 00:07:01,700
What about Anzhou?

151
00:07:02,259 --> 00:07:03,540
By my estimate,

152
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:05,220
whether it succeeds or fails,

153
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:06,980
Mr. Zhao should be on his way
back by now.

154
00:07:07,939 --> 00:07:09,020
Send out more goods.

155
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:11,299
I will do everything I can

156
00:07:11,379 --> 00:07:12,259
to build support for him.

157
00:07:12,739 --> 00:07:14,299
We're burning time.

158
00:07:15,379 --> 00:07:16,739
She's burning money.

159
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:21,259
We'll see who gives in first.

160
00:07:23,020 --> 00:07:23,939
Give me a hand.

161
00:07:23,939 --> 00:07:24,580
Come on.

162
00:07:25,419 --> 00:07:26,100
Here, hand it to me.

163
00:07:29,739 --> 00:07:30,419
Put it down carefully.

164
00:07:30,419 --> 00:07:30,859
Okay.

165
00:07:34,419 --> 00:07:34,980
Wait.

166
00:07:36,619 --> 00:07:37,220
Open it.

167
00:07:38,859 --> 00:07:39,780
Move!

168
00:07:47,179 --> 00:07:48,179
What are you staring at?

169
00:07:48,179 --> 00:07:48,859
Open them all!

170
00:07:48,859 --> 00:07:49,460
Yes.

171
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:50,340
Check them!

172
00:07:52,739 --> 00:07:53,619
I've looked into it.

173
00:07:53,819 --> 00:07:55,619
There was indeed a Jiuweijiao
in the Northwest in recent years.

174
00:07:55,619 --> 00:07:56,700
He built a very large business.

175
00:07:56,819 --> 00:07:57,580
He had

176
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,379
a type of salt called Ground Snow
that was as pure as official salt.

177
00:07:59,379 --> 00:08:00,739
He even controlled the transport routes.

178
00:08:01,179 --> 00:08:02,460
He wore a mask at all times.

179
00:08:02,939 --> 00:08:04,460
Ordinary people had never seen his face.

180
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:05,819
Everything matches.

181
00:08:07,419 --> 00:08:08,220
What happened after that?

182
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:10,220
Later, for some reason,

183
00:08:10,379 --> 00:08:11,819
he joined the army in Ganlin.

184
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:14,980
And after that?

185
00:08:15,059 --> 00:08:16,340
A few years later,

186
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,980
he was transferred to the capital

187
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:18,859
and became a court official.

188
00:08:18,939 --> 00:08:20,100
Do you know his surname?

189
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:21,580
I think...

190
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:22,700
his surname was Zhao.

191
00:08:24,059 --> 00:08:24,939
Ganlin.

192
00:08:25,499 --> 00:08:26,379
Joined the army.

193
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:27,419
Court official.

194
00:08:27,739 --> 00:08:28,460
Surname Zhao.

195
00:08:29,259 --> 00:08:30,540
Could it be Zhao Ling,

196
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,340
the one who was falsely accused

197
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:32,539
and had his family ruined?

198
00:08:32,779 --> 00:08:33,259
Hurry!

199
00:08:33,619 --> 00:08:35,820
Send an urgent report
to the Grand Secretary!

200
00:08:35,820 --> 00:08:36,820
Hurry!

201
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:37,300
Yes.

202
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:40,659
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
The rice, oil, salt, and tea

203
00:08:40,659 --> 00:08:42,019
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
we've bought from Xie lately

204
00:08:42,019 --> 00:08:44,139
weigh more than what other shops
give us.

205
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:45,019
Exactly.

206
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:47,340
Xie insists that their scales
are accurate.

207
00:08:47,340 --> 00:08:49,220
Then what we bought
from other shops before

208
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,180
must have been short-weighted!

209
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:51,940
Don't you owe us an explanation?

210
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,499
Give us an explanation!
Give us an explanation!

211
00:08:53,499 --> 00:08:54,420
You owe us an explanation!
Give us an explanation!

212
00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:55,700
Our scales are absolutely accurate.

213
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:56,700
Absolutely accurate.

214
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:57,980
Our scales

215
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:59,379
have all been inspected and approved
by the authorities.

216
00:08:59,379 --> 00:09:00,659
We've never shortchanged anyone.

217
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:02,019
Who runs a business

218
00:09:02,019 --> 00:09:03,340
by losing money just to sell more?

219
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:04,379
Wouldn't that disrupt the market?

220
00:09:04,379 --> 00:09:05,659
Move aside.

221
00:09:06,739 --> 00:09:07,300
Officer.

222
00:09:07,899 --> 00:09:08,420
Officer.

223
00:09:08,580 --> 00:09:09,539
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
You came just in time.

224
00:09:09,539 --> 00:09:10,580
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
Look at these people.

225
00:09:10,779 --> 00:09:11,940
Stop causing trouble.

226
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:12,499
Officer,

227
00:09:12,779 --> 00:09:14,539
you can't just ignore this.

228
00:09:14,539 --> 00:09:16,019
Who has actually been shortchanging us?

229
00:09:16,019 --> 00:09:17,859
You officials owe us an answer.

230
00:09:17,859 --> 00:09:19,220
Exactly.

231
00:09:19,220 --> 00:09:20,940
Can't the authorities even tell

232
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:21,980
how much one catty is?

233
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:23,220
How many standards are there?

234
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:24,300
How many different weights are there?

235
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:25,340
Exactly!

236
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,340
You need to take this

237
00:09:26,499 --> 00:09:27,619
to the Market Administration Office.

238
00:09:27,619 --> 00:09:29,060
Today, even if

239
00:09:29,139 --> 00:09:30,700
we get a few extra taels, that's fine.

240
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:33,019
But what if one day the authorities
collect goods from us

241
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:35,420
and claim they're short in weight?

242
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:36,420
If this continues,

243
00:09:36,539 --> 00:09:38,139
how can there be any standard at all?

244
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,060
Exactly.

245
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:40,100
Tell me,

246
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,259
could any official resist
the temptation?

247
00:09:42,100 --> 00:09:43,940
(Xie Jewelry Shop)
The pearl is worth ten thousand taels.

248
00:09:44,019 --> 00:09:46,100
No wonder the Yu family gives
such lavish gifts.

249
00:09:46,259 --> 00:09:47,619
They have a fortune

250
00:09:47,619 --> 00:09:48,739
backing them.

251
00:09:48,859 --> 00:09:50,180
Money seems to know where to go,

252
00:09:50,180 --> 00:09:51,580
straight into officials' pockets.

253
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:52,379
Once it goes there,

254
00:09:52,379 --> 00:09:53,499
it never comes our way.

255
00:09:53,580 --> 00:09:54,700
What are they showing off for?

256
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:56,139
Isn't that just proof
of how much they've taken?

257
00:09:59,340 --> 00:09:59,980
Master.

258
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,019
An urgent report from Anzhou.

259
00:10:01,019 --> 00:10:02,940
Zhao Ling obtained the gold weights
from the Anzhou Prefecture Office

260
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:04,340
and Shen Congsi's final letter.

261
00:10:04,859 --> 00:10:05,739
Why weren't you informed sooner

262
00:10:05,739 --> 00:10:06,899
about such a major matter?

263
00:10:07,220 --> 00:10:08,100
Forgive me, Master.

264
00:10:08,220 --> 00:10:09,659
It's all because Prefect Liu failed
in his duty.

265
00:10:09,659 --> 00:10:11,379
I calculated based on the date
the message was sent.

266
00:10:11,739 --> 00:10:13,100
Zhao Ling should be nearing Yuzhou.

267
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:14,499
He'll arrive in the capital
within the next two days.

268
00:10:30,019 --> 00:10:30,859
Issue the order.

269
00:10:31,859 --> 00:10:33,300
At any cost,

270
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:34,580
Zhao Ling must not

271
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:35,899
return to the capital alive.

272
00:10:36,259 --> 00:10:36,899
Yes.

273
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:50,019
I should have never killed Shen Congsi
in the first place.

274
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:53,060
Stop Zhao Ling at all costs.

275
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:54,779
He must not make it back
to the capital alive.

276
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:55,659
Yes.

277
00:10:55,659 --> 00:10:57,539
Deploy men along the road
from Yuzhou to the capital.

278
00:10:57,619 --> 00:10:58,779
Make sure nothing goes wrong.

279
00:11:01,899 --> 00:11:02,619
Move. Hurry.

280
00:11:09,739 --> 00:11:10,859
I never thought

281
00:11:11,180 --> 00:11:12,739
General Zhao would still be alive.

282
00:11:12,859 --> 00:11:13,700
Madam Zhao

283
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,899
won't have to live as a widow anymore.

284
00:11:16,180 --> 00:11:16,820
No.

285
00:11:17,259 --> 00:11:18,340
That's not the point.

286
00:11:18,659 --> 00:11:19,580
The real question

287
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:21,980
is why the Yu family fears him so much.

288
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:24,139
They even sent people to kill him
on the way.

289
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:28,220
Could it be

290
00:11:29,259 --> 00:11:30,700
that General Zhao has evidence

291
00:11:30,779 --> 00:11:32,539
that could bring the Yu family down?

292
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:34,539
If they fail,

293
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:36,259
the Yu family will face disaster.

294
00:11:37,019 --> 00:11:37,700
Cairong.

295
00:11:37,899 --> 00:11:38,980
Go pack our belongings.

296
00:11:38,980 --> 00:11:39,859
My Lady.

297
00:11:39,859 --> 00:11:41,019
I've already prepared everything.

298
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:48,019
I exchanged

299
00:11:48,019 --> 00:11:49,180
all the valuable jewelry
for silver notes.

300
00:11:49,259 --> 00:11:50,460
I've sewn them into the belt.

301
00:11:50,460 --> 00:11:51,580
There are several hundred taels
in there.

302
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:53,259
And I've prepared some silver pieces
as well,

303
00:11:53,259 --> 00:11:54,100
for expenses on the road.

304
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:55,100
Well done.

305
00:11:55,859 --> 00:11:56,379
Hurry.

306
00:11:56,379 --> 00:11:57,259
Tie this on.

307
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:14,340
Where are you going?

308
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:17,779
We're going to the estate

309
00:12:17,779 --> 00:12:19,340
to deliver some embroidery
to Young Madam.

310
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:24,180
Do you

311
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:25,100
want to see them?

312
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:25,619
No need.

313
00:12:37,980 --> 00:12:38,940
If you have time,

314
00:12:39,980 --> 00:12:41,539
could you go to Xie's for me?

315
00:12:47,899 --> 00:12:48,859
I understand.

316
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:02,499
Young Master.

317
00:13:03,460 --> 00:13:04,700
Instead of worrying about that,

318
00:13:04,940 --> 00:13:06,379
you should think more
about Young Master Ji.

319
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:08,700
Spend more time with him
these next few days.

320
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:10,700
After what happened before,

321
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:12,340
even if I went to Xie's,

322
00:13:12,539 --> 00:13:14,220
Fu Tingyun wouldn't see me.

323
00:13:15,779 --> 00:13:17,340
How dare you call her by her name?

324
00:13:20,659 --> 00:13:21,899
Then what should I call her?

325
00:13:22,180 --> 00:13:22,899
My ancestor?

326
00:13:23,379 --> 00:13:24,060
A goddess?

327
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:26,139
What nonsense are you talking about?

328
00:13:28,739 --> 00:13:29,739
I'll take my leave, Young Master.

329
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:51,460
(Yu Residence)

330
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,600
(Yu Residence)

331
00:14:03,139 --> 00:14:03,940
Madam.

332
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:05,340
Concubine Wu is here.

333
00:14:13,859 --> 00:14:14,820
What brings you here?

334
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,180
Madam, your performance

335
00:14:17,379 --> 00:14:18,539
has been quite convincing.

336
00:14:26,619 --> 00:14:27,700
What do you mean?

337
00:14:27,859 --> 00:14:29,019
Exactly what I said.

338
00:14:37,859 --> 00:14:38,619
Please take a seat.

339
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:44,820
Madam.

340
00:14:45,379 --> 00:14:46,779
I not only know

341
00:14:46,899 --> 00:14:48,180
that General Zhao is still alive,

342
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:49,859
but I also know

343
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:51,659
that he has obtained

344
00:14:51,659 --> 00:14:53,340
evidence that could destroy
the Yu family.

345
00:14:54,220 --> 00:14:55,100
But now,

346
00:14:55,420 --> 00:14:56,779
Grand Secretary Yu has ordered

347
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:59,139
that General Zhao be killed

348
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:00,779
at all costs

349
00:15:00,779 --> 00:15:01,739
before he returns to the capital.

350
00:15:02,499 --> 00:15:04,100
He has already reached Yuzhou.

351
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:05,980
He'll arrive in the capital
within two days.

352
00:15:06,739 --> 00:15:07,499
Madam,

353
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:09,499
you don't have much time left.

354
00:15:11,259 --> 00:15:12,220
What do you want?

355
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:14,340
I wonder if you

356
00:15:14,619 --> 00:15:15,940
still remember

357
00:15:16,659 --> 00:15:18,700
that I once asked you
for a new household register.

358
00:15:19,019 --> 00:15:20,379
The time has come.

359
00:15:20,779 --> 00:15:22,539
I want to leave the Yu family for good.

360
00:15:22,779 --> 00:15:24,220
I need your help.

361
00:15:25,619 --> 00:15:27,340
You want me to win

362
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:29,220
because you're afraid

363
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:30,420
the Yu family won't be ruined completely

364
00:15:30,619 --> 00:15:31,859
and will still have the power
to come after you.

365
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:33,580
Exactly.

366
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:41,899
I'll prepare

367
00:15:42,539 --> 00:15:43,859
what you need.

368
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:46,139
You won't survive on your own.

369
00:15:47,100 --> 00:15:48,899
After things calm down in a couple
of years,

370
00:15:49,619 --> 00:15:51,180
you can stay at one of Xie's branches

371
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,259
and become a manager.

372
00:15:52,739 --> 00:15:54,060
At least you'll have somewhere
to rely on.

373
00:15:58,180 --> 00:15:59,180
Thank you, Madam.

374
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:03,499
Thank you.

375
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,180
Madam.

376
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,499
I came here today

377
00:16:12,619 --> 00:16:13,820
without prior notice,

378
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:16,580
to ask something difficult of you.

379
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:18,340
I hope you can lend us a hand.

380
00:16:18,539 --> 00:16:19,220
As long as the Wang family

381
00:16:19,220 --> 00:16:20,940
can shield you from some of the trouble,

382
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:22,739
just tell me what you need.

383
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:28,379
Zhao Ling is already on his way
back to the capital.

384
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:30,300
Zhao Ling?

385
00:16:30,779 --> 00:16:31,700
He has

386
00:16:31,859 --> 00:16:33,379
the key evidence in his hands.

387
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:35,739
But the road ahead is filled
with danger.

388
00:16:36,940 --> 00:16:37,779
I beg you, Madam,

389
00:16:37,859 --> 00:16:39,259
to help him through the final stretch

390
00:16:39,259 --> 00:16:40,499
and ensure he reaches
the capital safely.

391
00:16:41,379 --> 00:16:42,139
Zhao Ling

392
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:43,739
is still alive?

393
00:16:47,899 --> 00:16:50,139
A border general mobilizing troops
is strictly forbidden.

394
00:16:56,739 --> 00:16:57,619
Commander Wang.

395
00:16:57,980 --> 00:16:58,779
If Zhao Ling

396
00:16:58,779 --> 00:16:59,899
falls before reaching the capital,

397
00:17:00,539 --> 00:17:02,220
the Yu faction will escape unscathed

398
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:03,379
and go free.

399
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:04,940
By then,

400
00:17:05,259 --> 00:17:06,380
all the efforts

401
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:07,940
will have been wasted.

402
00:17:08,180 --> 00:17:09,259
And countless injustices

403
00:17:09,339 --> 00:17:10,579
will remain buried forever.

404
00:17:11,339 --> 00:17:12,299
Things

405
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:14,499
have reached a critical point.

406
00:17:17,420 --> 00:17:18,739
Please rise and speak.

407
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:28,579
My Lord.

408
00:17:29,499 --> 00:17:31,059
We can't just stand by
and watch him die.

409
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:33,779
It's not that I would stand by
and watch him die.

410
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:35,420
It's just that

411
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:37,099
this is not a decision I can make alone.

412
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:39,140
Whether we can help Zhao Ling

413
00:17:39,579 --> 00:17:41,579
depends on whether the soldiers
in the Northwest

414
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:43,259
are willing to help him.

415
00:17:44,739 --> 00:17:46,499
I will explain the situation to them.

416
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:49,739
But I cannot order them to do so.

417
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,460
If he cannot make it back to court,

418
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,420
then it is simply fate.

419
00:18:03,339 --> 00:18:04,980
I would never blame

420
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:06,579
the people of the Northwest for it.

421
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:16,980
What is this?

422
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:18,339
Mr. Jin,

423
00:18:18,339 --> 00:18:19,420
these are local specialties

424
00:18:19,420 --> 00:18:20,420
sent from the Huaying shop.

425
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:21,579
It's not even a holiday.

426
00:18:21,579 --> 00:18:22,660
Why would they send me a gift?

427
00:18:35,339 --> 00:18:37,019
It says ten catties here.

428
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:38,940
But there are at least
14 catties inside.

429
00:18:43,819 --> 00:18:45,059
Who told you to bring this?

430
00:18:45,739 --> 00:18:46,460
Well...

431
00:18:46,860 --> 00:18:47,660
Speak.

432
00:18:57,940 --> 00:18:59,339
Madam Zhao sent you here?

433
00:18:59,739 --> 00:19:00,660
Quanhui said

434
00:19:00,739 --> 00:19:02,380
she wants to build support
for Mr. Zhao's return to the capital.

435
00:19:02,940 --> 00:19:04,380
She asks if you'll repent

436
00:19:04,539 --> 00:19:05,299
and help her.

437
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:08,339
Mr. Zhao

438
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:10,660
is returning to the capital?

439
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:13,420
He is alive?

440
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:16,539
She said

441
00:19:17,259 --> 00:19:18,980
that you cut off one of your ears
in Yongning Prefecture.

442
00:19:19,339 --> 00:19:20,220
She has never forgotten that.

443
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:22,019
And she believes

444
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:23,980
that you want this chance.

445
00:19:31,499 --> 00:19:32,700
It's fine if you don't help.

446
00:19:33,299 --> 00:19:34,460
We'll find another way.

447
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:45,539
Mr. Zhao is alive.

448
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:53,499
Mr. Zhao is alive.

449
00:20:19,059 --> 00:20:20,700
I, Jin Yuanbao,

450
00:20:21,019 --> 00:20:23,460
hereby accuse Grand Secretary Yu Guodong

451
00:20:23,739 --> 00:20:25,460
of framing a loyal official!

452
00:20:26,220 --> 00:20:27,940
I, Jin Yuanbao, confess my crimes.

453
00:20:28,339 --> 00:20:30,380
I falsely accused General Zhaoyong,
Zhao Ling.

454
00:20:32,539 --> 00:20:33,420
For years,

455
00:20:33,579 --> 00:20:35,259
Grand Secretary Yu used
the gold counterweight

456
00:20:35,739 --> 00:20:37,059
to manipulate measurements.

457
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,339
When we salt merchants

458
00:20:40,019 --> 00:20:41,779
delivered grain and supplies,

459
00:20:42,019 --> 00:20:44,180
we were forced to provide one catty and
seven taels for every catty required.

460
00:20:44,620 --> 00:20:45,660
No merchant is entirely honest.

461
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:47,779
To make up for the losses,

462
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:49,980
we

463
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,620
had no choice but to pass off
inferior goods as quality ones,

464
00:20:51,620 --> 00:20:52,660
hoard salt and drive up prices,

465
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:53,140
causing

466
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:54,739
prices to soar.

467
00:20:54,980 --> 00:20:55,980
When the salt reform was introduced,

468
00:20:56,099 --> 00:20:57,420
to adapt to the new policy,

469
00:20:57,539 --> 00:20:58,700
I sought refuge with Grand Secretary Yu.

470
00:20:59,299 --> 00:21:00,700
Under his orders,

471
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,140
I forged evidence

472
00:21:02,339 --> 00:21:03,579
to frame General Zhao.

473
00:21:03,660 --> 00:21:05,700
Those who falsely accuse others
of crimes punishable by death

474
00:21:06,180 --> 00:21:06,660
shall receive

475
00:21:06,660 --> 00:21:07,660
eighty strokes.

476
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:08,660
Do you

477
00:21:08,819 --> 00:21:09,739
confess your crimes?

478
00:21:11,819 --> 00:21:12,620
I confess.

479
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:14,539
Strike!

480
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:23,539
Will you

481
00:21:24,019 --> 00:21:25,339
change your statement?

482
00:21:25,339 --> 00:21:28,299
Never.

483
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:49,739
Isn't he that salt merchant?

484
00:21:49,739 --> 00:21:50,499
He always seemed

485
00:21:50,499 --> 00:21:51,739
to live quite a lavish life.

486
00:21:51,739 --> 00:21:52,819
After eighty strokes,

487
00:21:52,819 --> 00:21:54,140
he didn't even make a sound.

488
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:55,620
Grand Secretary Yu is truly ruthless.

489
00:21:55,700 --> 00:21:57,739
No wonder he was always giving away
such gifts, like that luminous pearl.

490
00:21:57,980 --> 00:21:59,099
(Convict Jin Yuanbao. Signed and marked)
Turns out his wealth

491
00:21:59,099 --> 00:22:00,420
(Convict Jin Yuanbao. Signed and marked)
was all taken from the people.

492
00:23:11,499 --> 00:23:12,620
I never thought

493
00:23:12,779 --> 00:23:14,460
that during all these days I've been
staying at the estate,

494
00:23:15,660 --> 00:23:17,420
you would be the first to come see me.

495
00:23:20,019 --> 00:23:21,860
I only hope I'll be the last one.

496
00:23:25,299 --> 00:23:26,779
The Yu family
is on the brink of collapse.

497
00:23:26,980 --> 00:23:28,220
They are barely holding on.

498
00:23:29,180 --> 00:23:29,980
Yake,

499
00:23:30,779 --> 00:23:32,259
if you want to survive,

500
00:23:33,339 --> 00:23:34,140
you should leave.

501
00:23:40,019 --> 00:23:41,579
You went through all this trouble

502
00:23:42,940 --> 00:23:44,539
just to warn me.

503
00:23:46,539 --> 00:23:47,739
If it were anyone else,

504
00:23:49,380 --> 00:23:51,180
I might have believed
it was out of friendship.

505
00:23:51,539 --> 00:23:52,299
But you've always been

506
00:23:53,259 --> 00:23:54,739
a master strategist,

507
00:23:55,980 --> 00:23:57,059
always planning several steps ahead.

508
00:24:00,420 --> 00:24:01,220
Tingyun,

509
00:24:02,499 --> 00:24:03,579
what do you want?

510
00:24:06,220 --> 00:24:07,420
I came here today

511
00:24:08,900 --> 00:24:09,980
to warn you,

512
00:24:11,779 --> 00:24:13,539
but I also have my own motives.

513
00:24:17,099 --> 00:24:18,220
If you have

514
00:24:18,299 --> 00:24:19,900
any evidence of the Yu family's crimes,

515
00:24:21,220 --> 00:24:22,059
give it to me.

516
00:24:23,819 --> 00:24:24,700
Then,

517
00:24:25,579 --> 00:24:26,900
I may be able

518
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:28,259
to secure a way out

519
00:24:28,739 --> 00:24:29,980
for you and Ji.

520
00:24:34,499 --> 00:24:35,940
The Yu family has committed
countless crimes.

521
00:24:37,700 --> 00:24:38,900
Whether I live or die

522
00:24:40,019 --> 00:24:41,180
is up to fate.

523
00:24:42,299 --> 00:24:43,860
It no longer matters.

524
00:24:46,940 --> 00:24:47,980
What about Ji?

525
00:24:48,220 --> 00:24:49,380
He is innocent.

526
00:24:50,499 --> 00:24:51,700
He's still in the residence.

527
00:24:52,819 --> 00:24:54,739
Everyone says you are heartless.

528
00:24:56,980 --> 00:24:57,940
But I know

529
00:24:59,099 --> 00:25:00,380
no mother

530
00:25:00,620 --> 00:25:01,980
could ever stop loving her child.

531
00:25:07,140 --> 00:25:07,980
I knew it.

532
00:25:09,700 --> 00:25:11,259
You are still trying to use him
to pressure me.

533
00:25:13,819 --> 00:25:14,660
Of course.

534
00:25:17,339 --> 00:25:18,900
Back then, I grew close to you

535
00:25:18,900 --> 00:25:20,420
because you shone so brightly,

536
00:25:22,019 --> 00:25:23,460
while I had nothing.

537
00:25:25,819 --> 00:25:27,940
I only wanted to borrow
a little warmth from your light.

538
00:25:29,499 --> 00:25:30,779
If this friendship

539
00:25:33,339 --> 00:25:35,700
was built on a swamp of schemes
from the very beginning,

540
00:25:37,099 --> 00:25:38,460
then the flowers it blooms

541
00:25:41,499 --> 00:25:43,259
could hardly retain any fragrance.

542
00:25:45,420 --> 00:25:46,980
Now I am lost in the fog,

543
00:25:49,140 --> 00:25:50,299
and I can no longer see clearly.

544
00:25:51,259 --> 00:25:52,980
Why should I force anything from you?

545
00:25:54,180 --> 00:25:55,660
There was a time

546
00:25:56,700 --> 00:25:58,660
when I considered you a true friend,
like family.

547
00:25:59,779 --> 00:26:01,539
I once shared with you

548
00:26:02,579 --> 00:26:04,220
many secrets between us.

549
00:26:06,779 --> 00:26:07,860
The first

550
00:26:07,940 --> 00:26:09,339
joys and sorrows of my life...

551
00:26:09,739 --> 00:26:11,420
I shared with you were always sincere.

552
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:15,099
But later,

553
00:26:17,499 --> 00:26:18,779
we both grew up.

554
00:26:20,180 --> 00:26:21,579
And everything changed.

555
00:26:23,779 --> 00:26:25,019
I did not come here today

556
00:26:25,620 --> 00:26:26,860
to reminisce about the past,

557
00:26:27,700 --> 00:26:28,940
nor to seek reconciliation.

558
00:26:29,460 --> 00:26:30,539
I came only to give you

559
00:26:30,980 --> 00:26:31,980
and Ji

560
00:26:32,700 --> 00:26:34,460
a chance to survive.

561
00:26:35,579 --> 00:26:36,620
I have already shown

562
00:26:37,779 --> 00:26:39,059
you a way out.

563
00:26:39,460 --> 00:26:40,620
Whether you believe me
or not is up to you.

564
00:26:46,499 --> 00:26:47,579
Since you are here,

565
00:26:49,339 --> 00:26:51,099
take this chest of my poems with you.

566
00:26:53,700 --> 00:26:54,940
It's almost laughable.

567
00:26:57,259 --> 00:26:58,739
I once prided myself on my talent,

568
00:27:00,499 --> 00:27:02,259
yet I was confined within this secluded
household.

569
00:27:04,940 --> 00:27:06,180
This chest of poems

570
00:27:07,620 --> 00:27:10,019
is all I can offer to honor the bond
we once shared.

571
00:27:11,059 --> 00:27:12,660
I hope you will put them to good use

572
00:27:13,259 --> 00:27:14,819
and let them see the light of day,

573
00:27:15,660 --> 00:27:16,779
rather than remain buried in dust.

574
00:27:19,940 --> 00:27:21,620
Are you truly not going to reconsider?

575
00:27:22,420 --> 00:27:23,739
Wasn't it you who said

576
00:27:25,099 --> 00:27:26,380
that whether you believe

577
00:27:26,499 --> 00:27:27,660
or choose

578
00:27:28,259 --> 00:27:29,660
all depends on a single thought?

579
00:27:30,140 --> 00:27:31,180
Doesn't that apply

580
00:27:32,620 --> 00:27:34,339
to you as well?

581
00:27:35,220 --> 00:27:36,299
Or is it that

582
00:27:37,739 --> 00:27:39,180
without something to gain,

583
00:27:42,099 --> 00:27:44,259
you would not even accept my poems?

584
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:35,560
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

585
00:28:35,560 --> 00:28:37,960
(Yu Residence Gift Record)

586
00:28:40,059 --> 00:28:40,779
This...

587
00:28:41,499 --> 00:28:42,860
This is the Yu family's

588
00:28:43,099 --> 00:28:44,779
record of social dealings.

589
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:47,664
(Yu Residence Gift Record)

590
00:28:48,220 --> 00:28:49,420
(Lord Cheng, Hanlin Academician)
This only records

591
00:28:49,420 --> 00:28:50,420
the inner residence's

592
00:28:50,420 --> 00:28:51,980
guest lists for banquets.

593
00:28:53,700 --> 00:28:54,900
Not just that.

594
00:28:59,259 --> 00:29:00,579
With this list,

595
00:29:02,739 --> 00:29:04,220
we can identify the members
of the Yu faction.

596
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:08,440
♪Once a bird in a cage♪
(Lidu Prefecture Advisor)

597
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:12,010
♪Longing for the boundless sky♪

598
00:29:12,768 --> 00:29:18,360
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

599
00:29:18,940 --> 00:29:20,339
So that's how it is.

600
00:29:26,180 --> 00:29:29,180
If I had not clung to this ridiculous
old affection,

601
00:29:31,019 --> 00:29:33,339
and looked through the poems
she gave me,

602
00:29:35,259 --> 00:29:36,299
this evidence

603
00:29:37,819 --> 00:29:40,220
would have remained buried
forever among old papers.

604
00:29:43,019 --> 00:29:45,420
But what if I had not held
on to those old feelings?

605
00:29:46,259 --> 00:29:48,099
What if I had thrown them away
without a second thought?

606
00:29:51,460 --> 00:29:56,304
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

607
00:29:56,700 --> 00:29:58,620
Who wants her schemes?

608
00:29:59,900 --> 00:30:02,380
Who wants her charity?

609
00:30:04,180 --> 00:30:05,059
Enough.

610
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:05,860
Hey.

611
00:30:10,020 --> 00:30:12,272
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

612
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:16,768
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

613
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:20,600
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

614
00:30:20,860 --> 00:30:21,700
Father.

615
00:30:24,180 --> 00:30:28,464
♪I seek nothing beyond the world♪

616
00:30:29,700 --> 00:30:34,944
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

617
00:30:36,499 --> 00:30:37,380
Ji.

618
00:30:39,900 --> 00:30:41,499
This is all I can do

619
00:30:43,499 --> 00:30:44,900
for you.

620
00:30:44,976 --> 00:30:48,960
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

621
00:30:49,780 --> 00:30:54,144
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

622
00:30:56,100 --> 00:31:00,304
♪I crave no clarity♪

623
00:31:01,500 --> 00:31:02,928
♪from outside my soul♪

624
00:31:03,460 --> 00:31:05,220
Wei Donglin is such a fool.

625
00:31:05,860 --> 00:31:08,620
His Majesty
clearly let a threat slip away.

626
00:31:08,819 --> 00:31:10,420
He is waiting for the right moment

627
00:31:10,620 --> 00:31:11,620
to wipe out

628
00:31:11,620 --> 00:31:12,860
the entire Yu faction in one stroke.

629
00:31:13,620 --> 00:31:15,700
Yet he remains completely unaware.

630
00:31:16,380 --> 00:31:18,180
He thinks that with Zhao Ling gone,

631
00:31:18,620 --> 00:31:19,660
this court

632
00:31:19,660 --> 00:31:20,380
would be

633
00:31:20,380 --> 00:31:22,460
entirely under Grand Secretary
Yu's control.

634
00:31:24,460 --> 00:31:26,460
Fortunately, I was quick to act

635
00:31:26,739 --> 00:31:29,779
and removed these promotion records
in time.

636
00:31:34,739 --> 00:31:35,860
It's

637
00:31:36,059 --> 00:31:37,420
up to you

638
00:31:37,420 --> 00:31:38,299
whether

639
00:31:38,860 --> 00:31:39,460
to protect him

640
00:31:39,460 --> 00:31:40,539
or not.

641
00:31:43,099 --> 00:31:44,099
I can't help it.

642
00:31:44,700 --> 00:31:45,499
I

643
00:31:45,940 --> 00:31:47,220
just like him.

644
00:31:47,460 --> 00:31:49,180
Keeping a dog is fine,

645
00:31:49,860 --> 00:31:50,620
but

646
00:31:50,940 --> 00:31:52,819
never forget to keep it on a leash.

647
00:31:58,380 --> 00:31:59,900
With this,

648
00:32:00,539 --> 00:32:02,019
no matter where this man

649
00:32:02,019 --> 00:32:03,380
climbs to in the future,

650
00:32:03,739 --> 00:32:05,900
even if he surpasses me someday,

651
00:32:05,900 --> 00:32:08,059
you can still bring him down.

652
00:32:08,700 --> 00:32:10,620
This is the last thing

653
00:32:10,779 --> 00:32:12,660
I leave for you.

654
00:32:12,779 --> 00:32:14,380
Keep it safe.

655
00:32:14,700 --> 00:32:17,019
Do not let him deceive you
into giving it away.

656
00:32:23,420 --> 00:32:24,460
Rest assured, Father.

657
00:32:25,059 --> 00:32:26,140
I will remember.

658
00:32:27,760 --> 00:32:31,040
(Liu Shulin, Ministry of Personnel
Zhao Shiqing, Ministry of Revenue)

659
00:34:18,179 --> 00:34:19,900
The Northwest Army is here.

660
00:34:24,860 --> 00:34:26,340
Though I'm old,

661
00:34:26,460 --> 00:34:28,099
can I still fight?

662
00:34:29,340 --> 00:34:30,300
Thank you, Commander Wang.

663
00:34:30,860 --> 00:34:32,539
A frontier general privately mobilizing
troops is a grave offense.

664
00:34:32,740 --> 00:34:33,900
But your loyalty,

665
00:34:34,619 --> 00:34:35,659
I, Zhao Ling, will never forget.

666
00:34:36,699 --> 00:34:38,780
General Zhao, you risked your life
for the Northwest for years.

667
00:34:39,219 --> 00:34:40,900
Today, the Northwest Army
will protect you.

668
00:34:40,980 --> 00:34:41,900
It is only right.

669
00:34:42,380 --> 00:34:43,820
What you have done for the Northwest,

670
00:34:44,099 --> 00:34:45,539
the brothers here all remember.

671
00:34:46,219 --> 00:34:47,139
Today,

672
00:34:47,619 --> 00:34:49,659
it is our turn to see you safely home.

673
00:34:59,340 --> 00:34:59,900
Look.

674
00:35:19,619 --> 00:35:20,820
They're back.

675
00:35:33,860 --> 00:35:35,260
After this rain,

676
00:35:36,380 --> 00:35:37,780
the sun should finally shine again.

677
00:35:41,820 --> 00:35:42,900
I, Zhao Ling,

678
00:35:43,019 --> 00:35:44,099
was ordered by Your Majesty
to investigate

679
00:35:44,179 --> 00:35:45,579
the case
of the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

680
00:35:45,579 --> 00:35:47,099
Shen Congsi's wrongful death.

681
00:35:47,740 --> 00:35:49,019
Today, I return to court!

682
00:35:49,659 --> 00:35:51,499
Lay down your armor
and enter the palace!

683
00:36:17,860 --> 00:36:18,820
I, Zhao Ling,

684
00:36:20,139 --> 00:36:21,139
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

685
00:36:21,539 --> 00:36:22,179
Rise.

686
00:36:23,059 --> 00:36:24,260
You all should know

687
00:36:24,380 --> 00:36:26,460
that Zhao Ling acted
under my secret decree

688
00:36:26,460 --> 00:36:27,980
to thoroughly investigate
the wrongful death of Shen Congsi,

689
00:36:27,980 --> 00:36:29,300
the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor.

690
00:36:30,219 --> 00:36:30,860
Huchen.

691
00:36:31,059 --> 00:36:32,659
Present the evidence

692
00:36:32,780 --> 00:36:33,940
you have gathered.

693
00:36:36,019 --> 00:36:36,579
I was

694
00:36:36,579 --> 00:36:37,460
ordered to investigate this case.

695
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:38,900
At Xie's in Anzhou,

696
00:36:38,980 --> 00:36:40,179
I found this final letter.

697
00:36:41,179 --> 00:36:42,940
It was written by Lord Shen himself.

698
00:36:43,300 --> 00:36:44,260
The words within

699
00:36:44,340 --> 00:36:45,260
are deeply moving.

700
00:36:45,579 --> 00:36:46,460
Please allow me

701
00:36:47,019 --> 00:36:47,980
to read it aloud.

702
00:36:48,619 --> 00:36:49,179
Granted.

703
00:36:55,980 --> 00:36:57,300
But I have already alarmed them.

704
00:36:57,539 --> 00:36:58,579
I fear I will not survive.

705
00:36:59,139 --> 00:36:59,740
Yet,

706
00:37:00,099 --> 00:37:01,420
to plead for the people's cause,

707
00:37:01,659 --> 00:37:02,940
even death is without regret.

708
00:37:03,740 --> 00:37:05,300
If anyone should read this letter,

709
00:37:05,539 --> 00:37:06,940
may they carry on

710
00:37:07,019 --> 00:37:08,260
and see it through.

711
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:11,219
Heaven has laid out countless paths
for all living beings,

712
00:37:12,940 --> 00:37:14,499
yet I alone walk the path of Asura.

713
00:37:14,944 --> 00:37:17,152
(Written by Shen Congsi)

714
00:37:29,499 --> 00:37:30,099
Your Majesty.

715
00:37:31,219 --> 00:37:32,219
There is one more matter.

716
00:37:39,499 --> 00:37:40,900
This is a standard weight.

717
00:37:41,699 --> 00:37:42,699
It bears no seal or marking.

718
00:37:44,380 --> 00:37:45,499
But this one

719
00:37:47,539 --> 00:37:49,699
bears the official seal
of Anzhou Prefecture.

720
00:37:54,740 --> 00:37:56,460
This was done by the authorities.

721
00:37:58,420 --> 00:37:58,860
This...

722
00:38:27,980 --> 00:38:29,659
This weight is made of iron wrapped
in copper.

723
00:38:29,780 --> 00:38:31,619
For every catty and seven taels
of grain the salt merchants paid,

724
00:38:31,820 --> 00:38:33,219
the authorities recorded only one catty.

725
00:38:33,780 --> 00:38:34,780
Over the years,

726
00:38:35,460 --> 00:38:36,780
the embezzled amount
became immeasurable.

727
00:38:39,019 --> 00:38:40,940
Furthermore, Lord Shen stated
in his letter

728
00:38:41,380 --> 00:38:42,499
that the grain loss issue

729
00:38:42,900 --> 00:38:44,099
was connected to Grand Secretary Yu.

730
00:38:44,740 --> 00:38:46,099
And now, this golden weight

731
00:38:46,340 --> 00:38:47,340
also

732
00:38:47,900 --> 00:38:49,099
points to Grand Secretary Yu.

733
00:38:53,499 --> 00:38:54,420
Grand Secretary Yu.

734
00:38:55,820 --> 00:38:56,579
Do you

735
00:38:56,780 --> 00:38:58,019
have anything to say?

736
00:38:58,380 --> 00:38:59,019
Your Majesty,

737
00:38:59,499 --> 00:39:01,260
these are all false accusations
and framing.

738
00:39:01,579 --> 00:39:03,099
Everything General Zhao has said

739
00:39:03,099 --> 00:39:04,699
has nothing to do with me.

740
00:39:05,300 --> 00:39:08,139
Please allow me some time to refute
each accusation.

741
00:39:08,340 --> 00:39:09,300
Before that,

742
00:39:09,980 --> 00:39:12,179
I would like to ask
Commander Wang first.

743
00:39:13,579 --> 00:39:14,499
The Northwest Army

744
00:39:15,099 --> 00:39:16,619
belongs to the imperial court.

745
00:39:17,059 --> 00:39:19,019
What punishment should one face
for mobilizing troops without a decree?

746
00:39:19,740 --> 00:39:20,499
Commander Wang.

747
00:39:21,059 --> 00:39:22,139
Are the Northwest Army

748
00:39:22,740 --> 00:39:24,300
your troops,

749
00:39:24,780 --> 00:39:26,579
or His Majesty's?

750
00:39:32,659 --> 00:39:33,380
Your Majesty,

751
00:39:33,579 --> 00:39:34,460
I am guilty.

752
00:39:34,860 --> 00:39:36,539
I accept whatever punishment
Your Majesty deems fit.

753
00:39:37,099 --> 00:39:38,460
But I ask Your Majesty to see clearly.

754
00:39:38,780 --> 00:39:40,619
There was indeed injustice in the case
of Mo Yi.

755
00:39:40,980 --> 00:39:42,659
I stake my life on this.

756
00:39:42,659 --> 00:39:43,219
Mo Yi

757
00:39:43,219 --> 00:39:45,260
was never a corrupt official.

758
00:39:45,579 --> 00:39:46,539
I believe

759
00:39:46,539 --> 00:39:47,340
this case

760
00:39:47,619 --> 00:39:49,900
must also be connected
to Grand Secretary Yu.

761
00:39:51,099 --> 00:39:53,019
I ask Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly.

762
00:39:54,059 --> 00:39:56,059
General Zhao, you think you can rely

763
00:39:56,179 --> 00:39:57,579
on a single weight to pin

764
00:39:57,579 --> 00:39:58,780
these baseless crimes on me?

765
00:39:59,740 --> 00:40:01,420
What if there is more
than one golden weight?

766
00:40:05,420 --> 00:40:06,019
Your Majesty,

767
00:40:06,340 --> 00:40:07,659
I was ordered to investigate

768
00:40:07,659 --> 00:40:08,659
the golden weight case.

769
00:40:08,860 --> 00:40:09,820
In Minzhou,

770
00:40:09,820 --> 00:40:11,019
I recovered crucial evidence

771
00:40:11,019 --> 00:40:12,059
and have come to report!

772
00:40:12,219 --> 00:40:12,820
I

773
00:40:12,820 --> 00:40:14,139
have brought back
the golden weight from Yuzhou

774
00:40:14,139 --> 00:40:15,099
and have come to report!

775
00:40:15,340 --> 00:40:15,980
I

776
00:40:15,980 --> 00:40:17,219
have brought back the golden weight
from Qianzhou

777
00:40:17,219 --> 00:40:18,139
and have come to report!

778
00:40:18,260 --> 00:40:18,900
I

779
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:20,059
have brought back
the golden weight from Langzhou

780
00:40:20,059 --> 00:40:21,059
and have come to report!

781
00:40:22,460 --> 00:40:23,260
Rise.

782
00:40:26,219 --> 00:40:26,740
I

783
00:40:26,740 --> 00:40:27,780
impeach Grand Secretary Yu

784
00:40:27,780 --> 00:40:28,780
for embezzling salt tax revenues.

785
00:40:29,340 --> 00:40:31,699
After Salt Transport Commissioner Yan
of Yongning was brought to justice,

786
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,619
he colluded with his successor,

787
00:40:33,940 --> 00:40:35,460
continued illegally selling
salt permits,

788
00:40:35,460 --> 00:40:36,420
and embezzled state taxes.

789
00:40:36,900 --> 00:40:38,539
Even the confiscated property
of the Yan family

790
00:40:38,539 --> 00:40:39,579
was taken for personal gain.

791
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:42,019
He also used these iron weights
wrapped in copper

792
00:40:42,380 --> 00:40:44,380
to embezzle countless amounts
of salt tax over the years.

793
00:40:45,099 --> 00:40:46,460
Even more outrageous,

794
00:40:46,900 --> 00:40:48,340
to conceal his crimes,

795
00:40:48,619 --> 00:40:50,980
he even poisoned
Imperial Salt Censor Shen Congsi.

796
00:40:51,900 --> 00:40:53,179
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

797
00:40:53,179 --> 00:40:54,380
for embezzling military provisions

798
00:40:54,539 --> 00:40:56,499
and colluding with Li Mao,
the Gandu Circuit Military Advisor,

799
00:40:56,499 --> 00:40:57,900
to act together in corruption.

800
00:40:58,019 --> 00:40:59,179
During the transport of grain shipments,

801
00:40:59,260 --> 00:41:00,659
he falsified losses,

802
00:41:00,659 --> 00:41:01,780
mixed sand and water into the grain,

803
00:41:01,780 --> 00:41:02,780
and resold military provisions.

804
00:41:03,019 --> 00:41:03,900
After the crime was exposed,

805
00:41:04,059 --> 00:41:06,300
he forced Li Mao to his death
and framed Mo Yi,

806
00:41:06,300 --> 00:41:08,139
silencing them both.

807
00:41:09,019 --> 00:41:09,619
I

808
00:41:09,619 --> 00:41:11,460
impeach Grand Secretary Yu
for framing loyal officials,

809
00:41:11,820 --> 00:41:13,139
for ordering the salt merchant

810
00:41:13,260 --> 00:41:14,139
Jin Yuanbao

811
00:41:14,139 --> 00:41:15,340
to falsely accuse Zhao Ling.

812
00:41:15,340 --> 00:41:16,780
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

813
00:41:16,780 --> 00:41:18,099
for forming factions
and pursuing personal gain.

814
00:41:18,380 --> 00:41:19,619
Among the Six Ministries
and Nine Chief Ministers,

815
00:41:19,699 --> 00:41:21,380
half are his followers.

816
00:41:21,380 --> 00:41:22,460
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

817
00:41:22,460 --> 00:41:23,380
for corrupting the salt administration,

818
00:41:23,380 --> 00:41:25,380
using salt reform as a pretext

819
00:41:25,380 --> 00:41:26,659
to fill his own coffers.

820
00:41:27,340 --> 00:41:28,539
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu,

821
00:41:28,699 --> 00:41:29,900
for his own personal gain,

822
00:41:30,179 --> 00:41:31,579
ordering Fifth Master Fu

823
00:41:31,579 --> 00:41:33,300
to poison his wife Xie,

824
00:41:33,619 --> 00:41:35,699
and forcing me to step down
in the name of filial duty.

825
00:41:36,139 --> 00:41:38,260
Such a parasite who harms
the nation and its people,

826
00:41:38,820 --> 00:41:40,460
if he is not executed,
how can the court's order be restored?

827
00:41:40,460 --> 00:41:41,300
If he is not beheaded,

828
00:41:41,579 --> 00:41:43,139
how can the people's anger be appeased?

829
00:41:43,820 --> 00:41:45,699
Seconded.

830
00:41:45,740 --> 00:41:47,860
Seconded.

831
00:41:48,499 --> 00:41:49,179
Furthermore,

832
00:41:50,059 --> 00:41:51,420
Master Zhenghe

833
00:41:52,059 --> 00:41:54,219
has brought a list of Grand Secretary
Yu's faction members.

834
00:41:55,059 --> 00:41:55,780
Summon

835
00:41:55,900 --> 00:41:58,579
Master Zhenghe to court.

836
00:42:09,969 --> 00:42:12,800
(Received rare books from Lord Cheng
to be returned with cloth as gifts)

837
00:42:20,139 --> 00:42:21,300
Grand Secretary Yu,

838
00:42:22,099 --> 00:42:24,059
you and your accomplices divided
the spoils among yourselves,

839
00:42:24,619 --> 00:42:26,380
thinking your power was deeply rooted.

840
00:42:27,499 --> 00:42:28,460
But I'm afraid

841
00:42:29,900 --> 00:42:31,380
greed will eventually lose to anger.

842
00:42:33,900 --> 00:42:36,460
As long as one person points a sword
at you,

843
00:42:37,780 --> 00:42:38,619
the people's fury

844
00:42:40,340 --> 00:42:43,099
will become thousands
of blades turned against you.

845
00:42:51,260 --> 00:42:53,340
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

846
00:42:53,659 --> 00:42:56,699
I have always sought only to ease
Your Majesty's burdens

847
00:42:56,699 --> 00:42:58,340
and relieve the treasury's troubles.

848
00:42:58,499 --> 00:43:00,539
That is why I have ended up today

849
00:43:00,539 --> 00:43:02,940
surrounded and attacked by everyone
in court.

850
00:43:03,179 --> 00:43:05,699
Yet my loyalty remains true.

851
00:43:06,420 --> 00:43:10,579
Knowing this would offend
the newly risen officials,

852
00:43:10,860 --> 00:43:12,940
I still did it for the sake
of the realm.

853
00:43:12,940 --> 00:43:14,980
I persisted despite all opposition,

854
00:43:15,059 --> 00:43:18,099
only to become the target

855
00:43:18,099 --> 00:43:20,099
of everyone's condemnation.

856
00:43:20,780 --> 00:43:23,820
Your Majesty, please judge fairly.

857
00:43:28,619 --> 00:43:29,420
Grand Secretary,

858
00:43:30,340 --> 00:43:30,980
I also

859
00:43:31,579 --> 00:43:32,860
entrusted you

860
00:43:32,860 --> 00:43:34,579
with such an important position

861
00:43:35,460 --> 00:43:37,420
because the treasury was empty.

862
00:43:38,019 --> 00:43:39,099
Who would have thought

863
00:43:39,579 --> 00:43:40,980
you would fill

864
00:43:41,460 --> 00:43:44,340
the Yu family's accounts
instead of the imperial treasury?

865
00:43:44,340 --> 00:43:46,260
The people's money

866
00:43:46,539 --> 00:43:47,420
ended up

867
00:43:47,539 --> 00:43:50,019
in your own pockets.

868
00:43:50,539 --> 00:43:51,699
I am innocent.

869
00:43:51,699 --> 00:43:52,380
Three days.

870
00:43:52,699 --> 00:43:54,099
The Three Judicial Offices shall,
within three days,

871
00:43:54,099 --> 00:43:56,179
jointly hear the case
of Grand Academician Yu Guodong.

872
00:43:56,300 --> 00:43:58,539
All those involved shall be severely
punished without exception.

873
00:43:59,300 --> 00:44:00,499
Commander Wang Yi of Gandu

874
00:44:00,499 --> 00:44:01,539
shall be stripped of his position

875
00:44:01,619 --> 00:44:03,099
for the unauthorized troop
mobilization matter.

876
00:44:03,260 --> 00:44:04,059
As a common subject,

877
00:44:04,059 --> 00:44:05,059
he shall assist in the investigation.

878
00:44:06,139 --> 00:44:08,300
Your Majesty is wise and just.

879
00:44:11,019 --> 00:44:12,900
Your Majesty is wise and just.

880
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:21,260
(Next Episode)

881
00:44:21,539 --> 00:44:23,260
What I desire,

882
00:44:23,740 --> 00:44:24,780
Jingxiu,

883
00:44:24,940 --> 00:44:27,099
you must do your utmost to fulfill.

884
00:44:28,219 --> 00:44:29,820
Who doesn't know about

885
00:44:29,820 --> 00:44:31,099
the things you've been doing?

886
00:44:31,579 --> 00:44:32,980
Do you think I have no one else

887
00:44:32,980 --> 00:44:34,260
to serve me in this court?

888
00:44:34,420 --> 00:44:36,300
Look at what has become
of the world outside!

889
00:44:36,300 --> 00:44:37,619
Even you, Madam,

890
00:44:37,619 --> 00:44:38,619
are nothing more

891
00:44:38,820 --> 00:44:40,179
than a vessel for men's power.

892
00:44:40,179 --> 00:44:41,179
But if I

893
00:44:41,860 --> 00:44:43,260
go to prison and face punishment,

894
00:44:43,260 --> 00:44:45,340
the Yu family will be finished.

895
00:44:45,340 --> 00:44:47,300
Have you come to take my life?

896
00:45:03,960 --> 00:45:08,280
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

897
00:45:11,880 --> 00:45:16,240
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

898
00:45:18,360 --> 00:45:23,000
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

899
00:45:23,240 --> 00:45:26,040
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

900
00:45:27,200 --> 00:45:31,840
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

901
00:45:35,040 --> 00:45:41,880
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

902
00:45:42,760 --> 00:45:49,280
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

903
00:45:50,240 --> 00:45:53,680
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

904
00:45:54,200 --> 00:45:58,400
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

905
00:45:58,680 --> 00:46:04,360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

906
00:46:16,480 --> 00:46:20,360
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

907
00:46:24,280 --> 00:46:28,280
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

908
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:34,680
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

909
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:37,680
♪Kept close within my heart♪

910
00:46:38,760 --> 00:46:43,600
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

911
00:46:47,120 --> 00:46:54,040
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

912
00:46:54,920 --> 00:47:01,400
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

913
00:47:02,280 --> 00:47:05,800
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

914
00:47:06,240 --> 00:47:10,600
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

915
00:47:10,800 --> 00:47:16,520
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

